  "bodyHash": "JQWdge2QzqY=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/RESOURCECONFIG/BH_RC_HEADER.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/RESOURCECONFIG/BH_RC_OVERVIEW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"111\"></p><h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif\">我们让跨平台配置变得超级简单！</span></h5><h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></h5><h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif\">在Forge上，我们使用官方的Forge配置系统来实现热重载。</span></h5><h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif\">而在Fabric上，我们使用JSONC，因为他们没有自己的系统。</span></h5><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif\">从1.20版本开始，我们不再使用Forge的官方系统，因为它很容易出问题。</span></p><h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></h5><h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif\">我们还为年轻人设计了一个酷炫的UI，因为他们懒嘛。</span></h5><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/gwudTd.png\" alt=\"这个配置简直酷毙了！\" width=\"2246\" height=\"1400\"></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/resourcefulbees\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/RESOURCECONFIG/BH_RC_DISCORD.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"111\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fteamresourceful\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/RESOURCECONFIG/BH_RC_PROMO.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"227\"></a></p>",
